[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Isles of the Golden Sun</h2>
<i>"Wise are those who see the true power in Storm Crystals, for they are the source of all energy."<br></i>
-- Advisor of the Thunder Fury, Gaila

<p> The Golden Emperor currently rules the Isles of the Golden Sun, known for its rich source of storm crystals. If you conquer his mines, nothing will stop you from a decisive victory over the Valdras Empire.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Mines Secured!</h2>
<p>You have successfully secured the mines in the Isles of the Golden Sun! Now you have enough power to achieve your goal - absolute victory over the fallen Valdras kingdom!

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,1
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,RblScen4

[Failed]
<h2>Failure..</h2>
<p>
Blood has been shed upon your throne,<br>
And low rests your head.<br>
Through troubled times and ugly lies,<br>
Alas, my friend, you are dead.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]